<p class="mol-para-with-font">That is the superb second a girl swung by her hair on a practice handrail.</p>
<p class="mol-para-with-font">Footage exhibits the Russian acrobat, named Darina, hooked up to the metallic bar by her hair in Shanghai on January 21.</p>
<p class="mol-para-with-font">She was seen tapping on her telephone along with her legs crossed as she hung from the bar.  </p>
