<p class="imageCaption">She was seen tapping on her telephone along with her legs crossed as she hung from the bar</p>
</div>
<p class="mol-para-with-font">Hair hanging is an aerial circus act the place performers are suspended by their hair. Some folks imagine the act originated in South America whereas others imagine it started in China.</p>
<p class="mol-para-with-font">They carry out acrobatic poses whereas their hair is tied right into a hair cling ring and the load of the individual&#8217;s weight is evenly distributed throughout the scalp. </p>
<p class="mol-para-with-font">Every hair is ready to maintain a weight of as much as 3.5oz (100g) and should be organized correctly with a view to stop accidents or accidents.</p>
<p class="mol-para-with-font">Performers typically situation their hair as much as 5 instances a day and use hair nutritional vitamins in a bid to guard it and preserve it robust.  </p>
<p class="mol-para-with-font">The act could cause neck and shoulder ache in addition to complications and sometimes when performers are on tour they discover a toughened space on the prime of their scalp. </p>
